# dtp-yui — CV Job Copilot

## cv-web UI (cv/services/web)
- develop new features with code that is as modular and scalable as possible
- use Tailwind CSS v4 and coss UI components for all UI styling
- coss primitives live in cv/services/web/components/ui/*.tsx; keep pages, lib, and API routes in JavaScript
- preserve Netflix-style dark theming with hot pink (#ff1493) accents via coss semantic tokens
- do not implement features that will leak any sensitive app information or credentials
- if creating ai prompts, save all the prompts on the server-side
- add new database fields with camelCase

## Cursor skills
- Use .cursor/skills/coss when building or migrating UI with coss primitives
- Use .cursor/skills/coss-particles for copy-paste particle patterns
- Use .cursor/skills/frontend-design for distinctive visual design choices
